#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Start your quantum journey {#start-your-quantum-journey}"
msgstr "Mulai perjalanan kuantummu {#start-your-quantum-journey}"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Get started {#get-started}"
msgstr "Mulai {#get-started}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This training is designed for both experts and non-experts who want to learn"
" the basics of quantum computing to accelerate applications in their "
"organization. It provides opportunities to learn about potential industry "
"applications, quantum computing core concepts, and IBM Quantum&reg; products"
" and services.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pelatihan ini dirancang untuk para ahli maupun non-ahli yang ingin "
"mempelajari dasar-dasar komputasi kuantum guna mempercepat aplikasi dalam "
"organisasi mereka. Pelatihan ini memberikan kesempatan untuk belajar tentang"
" potensi aplikasi industri, konsep inti komputasi kuantum, serta produk dan "
"layanan IBM Quantum&reg;.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Tips for navigating this course {#tips-for-navigating-this-course}"
msgstr "Tips navigasi kursus ini {#tips-for-navigating-this-course}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this digital course, you can pace your learning however you prefer. If "
"you need to leave the course, you can easily return later. To view the "
"lessons in each module, click on the module title in the left-hand menu. "
"From there, you can click on a lesson title to view the material. Lessons "
"contain a combination of media. We recommend reading all text, not otherwise"
" marked as optional, and watching all the videos. All links in this course "
"are optional resources and references. \n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam kursus digital ini, kamu bisa mengatur kecepatan belajar sesuai "
"preferensimu. Jika kamu perlu meninggalkan kursus, kamu bisa kembali lagi "
"dengan mudah nanti. Untuk melihat pelajaran di setiap modul, klik judul "
"modul di menu sebelah kiri. Dari sana, kamu bisa klik judul pelajaran untuk "
"melihat materinya. Pelajaran berisi kombinasi media. Kami menyarankan "
"membaca semua teks yang tidak ditandai sebagai opsional, dan menonton semua "
"video. Semua tautan dalam kursus ini adalah sumber daya dan referensi "
"opsional.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The total duration is approximately 2–3 hours for reviewing the content "
"directly in this course. However, visiting each link and reference may take "
"additional time, depending on your level of interest in these resources.\n"
msgstr ""
"Total durasi kursus adalah sekitar 2–3 jam untuk meninjau konten langsung "
"dalam kursus ini. Namun, mengunjungi setiap tautan dan referensi mungkin "
"membutuhkan waktu tambahan, tergantung pada tingkat minatmu terhadap sumber "
"daya tersebut.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Earning the Quantum Business Foundations badge {#earning-the-quantum-"
"business-foundations-badge}"
msgstr ""
"Mendapatkan lencana Quantum Business Foundations {#earning-the-quantum-"
"business-foundations-badge}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Upon completion of the course, you can follow the link to IBM Training to "
"take a badging exam if you wish. Upon passing the badging exam you will earn"
" your IBM Quantum Business Foundations badge.\n"
msgstr ""
"Setelah menyelesaikan kursus, kamu bisa mengikuti tautan ke IBM Training "
"untuk mengikuti ujian lencana jika kamu mau. Setelah lulus ujian lencana, "
"kamu akan mendapatkan lencana IBM Quantum Business Foundations milikmu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![IBM Quantum Business Badge](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-"
"foundations/exam/badge.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![IBM Quantum Business Badge](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-"
"foundations/exam/badge.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Course overview {#course-overview}"
msgstr "Ikhtisar kursus {#course-overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "By the end of this course, you will be able to\n"
msgstr "Di akhir kursus ini, kamu akan mampu\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Recognize the potential business use cases and impacts of quantum "
"computing\n"
msgstr ""
"Mengenali potensi kasus penggunaan bisnis dan dampak komputasi kuantum\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Understand the current state and future of quantum computing\n"
msgstr "Memahami keadaan saat ini dan masa depan komputasi kuantum\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Evaluate news on quantum computing, including interpreting quantum computing"
" terminology\n"
msgstr ""
"Mengevaluasi berita tentang komputasi kuantum, termasuk menafsirkan "
"terminologi komputasi kuantum\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Find key resources to learn more about quantum computing\n"
msgstr ""
"Menemukan sumber daya utama untuk mempelajari lebih lanjut tentang komputasi"
" kuantum\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Identify the steps that you can take to become quantum ready\n"
msgstr ""
"Mengidentifikasi langkah-langkah yang bisa kamu ambil untuk menjadi quantum "
"ready\n"
